Module: Divide and Conquer Algorithms
Learnings: 
I learned how to solve complex problems efficiently by breaking them into smaller subproblems, solving them independently, and combining their results.  
This approach helps in reducing the overall time complexity of many recursive problems.  
Algorithms like Merge Sort and Quick Sort clearly demonstrate the power of the divide and conquer technique in sorting and searching problems.
